<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Restore (230)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>restore &lt;someone&gt;
restore self
restore all
</pre>
<p>Restores someone to full health: hit points, mana and endurance to their 
maximum, and no longer hungry or thirsty. It works on a player or a 
monster anywhere in the game; they are told "&lt;you&gt; has restored you to 
health."
</p><p>restore all does the same for every player in the game, who are told 
that you "restored the world to health!". It is logged.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Set</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hits</a>
</pre>




</div>